.Dd October 30, 2026
.Dt AUTODISKMOUNT 8
.Os Minkar
.Sh NAME
.Nm autodiskmount
.Nd mount the volumes that are not mounted
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl v
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
asks
.Xr diskarbitrationd 8
to mount every volume it knows that is not mounted, by the rules it
follows when a disk appears: the volumes it would mount on its own, where
it would mount them (in
.Pa /Volumes ,
or as
.Xr fstab 5
says).
A volume it does not mount on its own, such as an EFI partition, stays
unmounted; so do those
.Xr fstab 5
marks
.Cm noauto .
.Pp
macOS keeps the command for compatibility, with no options.
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl v
Tells each volume mounted and where.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
0, or 1 when diskarbitrationd cannot be reached.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr diskutil 8 ,
.Xr fstab 5 ,
.Xr diskarbitrationd 8
.Sh HISTORY
This
.Nm
was written for Minkar.
